        "original_id": "feb5e0f7-70a3-5bf1-8ea2-9c91f7ae28a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Ullyett, Billie Jean King, Samantha Stosur, Scott Draper, Liezel Huber\n- Events: 2005 Australian Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Topics: men's doubles, mixed doubles, professional tennis\n\nFacts:\n- Billie Jean King, née Moffitt, was born on November 22, 1943, and she is an American former World No. 1 professional tennis player.\n- Kevin Ullyett's primary success on the tennis tour was in men's doubles.\n- At the 2005 Australian Open mixed doubles event, Samantha Stosur and Scott Draper defeated Liezel Huber and Kevin Ullyett in the final 6–2, 2–6, 10–6.\n- Samantha Stosur and Scott Draper won the mixed doubles title at the 2005 Australian Open tennis tournament.",
